; expect 43
; A function value stored in a data constructor field and recovered by
; a match binder, then called: construction, the pattern load, and the
; indirect call all treat it as the plain word it is.
(data FB (MkF (-> Int Int)))
(:: inc (-> Int Int))
(fn (inc x) (+ x 1))
(:: main Int)
(fn (main) (match (MkF inc) ((MkF g) (g 42))))
